        <div class="section">
            <h2>Professional Summary</h2>
            <p>Aspiring AWS Cloud Engineer with hands-on experience delivering serverless and data solutions on AWS. Combines AWS Cloud Practitioner certification with practical project work in Lambda, EC2, S3, Glue, Athena, and Python automation. Background in IT support and service operations gives strong troubleshooting, incident management, and process discipline. Seeking a junior cloud or AWS-focused role where I can contribute to production cloud environments and grow into an engineering practice.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Work Experience</h2>

            <div class="experience-item">
                <div class="experience-title">Virtual Personal Assistant</div>
                <div class="experience-company">Message Direct</div>
                <div class="experience-duration">January 2026 - Present</div>
                <p>Manage inbound calls, message taking, and call routing for SME clients. Apply problem-solving and communication skills to support callers and coordinate with teams.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="experience-item">
                <div class="experience-title">Customer Advisor</div>
                <div class="experience-company">Sureserve via Agy.</div>
                <div class="experience-duration">December 2024 - June 2025</div>
                <p>Managed inbound and outbound communications across phone, email, and online channels. Scheduled appointments, resolved escalations, and maintained accurate service records.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="experience-item">
                <div class="experience-title">Cash Processor</div>
                <div class="experience-company">AMS (agy) Natwest</div>
                <div class="experience-duration">July 2024 - December 2024</div>
                <p>Processed and audited cash deposits for major retail clients, ensuring accuracy and compliance. Maintained detailed records and followed procedures for discrepancies, supporting audit readiness.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="experience-item">
                <div class="experience-title">Junior IT Helpdesk Engineer</div>
                <div class="experience-company">Cantium</div>
                <div class="experience-duration">October 2023 - February 2024</div>
                <p>Delivered first-line IT support to Kent County Council staff, resolving issues with Microsoft Teams, Outlook, and 8x8 telephony. Performed troubleshooting for storage, printers, and access management, escalating to second-line support when required. Logged and tracked incidents in ServiceNow, improving resolution tracking and handover accuracy.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="experience-item">
                <div class="experience-title">IT Helpdesk Analyst</div>
                <div class="experience-company">Nuffield Health</div>
                <div class="experience-duration">September 2021 - August 2023</div>
                <p>Provided remote first-line IT support across UK hospitals and gyms, handling M365, printers, network issues, and hardware. Investigated malware and security incidents, escalating confirmed threats to Security IT with documented findings. Monitored site and network health via SolarWinds, verifying outages and communicating updates until resolution. Supported payment systems, gate access, and Windows profile recovery to minimize business downtime.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="experience-item">
                <div class="experience-title">Call Centre Associate</div>
                <div class="experience-company">Agilisys (Kent County Council)</div>
                <div class="experience-duration">June 2019 - June 2021</div>
                <p>Supported Blue Badge and education service inquiries, guiding applicants through processes and escalating complex cases.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

