            <div class="projects-grid">
                <div class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-content">
                        <div class="project-title">Serverless Data Querying Solution</div>
                        <div class="project-description">
                            Built a serverless pipeline on AWS using Glue for ETL, Athena for SQL querying, and S3 for storage. Enabled querying of CSV datasets through SQL without managing servers, demonstrating cost-efficient cloud architecture.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="project-card">
